# app/.env.release — Cloudflare R2 credentials for `npm run release` (the §F-1 auto-update feed upload).
# Copy to app/.env.release (gitignored) and fill in. Create the bucket + a scoped API token once:
#   1. wrangler r2 bucket create cubic-releases   (or Cloudflare dashboard → R2)
#   2. R2 → Manage API Tokens → create a token with Object Read & Write on the cubic-releases bucket
#      → gives the Access Key ID + Secret Access Key below; the Account ID is on the R2 overview page.
R2_ACCOUNT_ID=your-cloudflare-account-id
R2_ACCESS_KEY_ID=your-r2-access-key-id
R2_SECRET_ACCESS_KEY=your-r2-secret-access-key
# Optional — defaults to cubic-releases
# R2_BUCKET=cubic-releases
